Subject: Input: add the Novatek NT36532E SPI touchscreen driver

Carry the touchscreen, firmware and panel-event integration required by Piano.

The port retains changes from these linux-piano commits:
piano: touch: port Novatek NT36532E SPI driver from sheng tree (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)
piano: NT36532 THP touch bring-up (milestone-touch) (#11) (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)

The cited SunUEFI changes were carried through the 7.3 port.

